e=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">When you get home, here are some things you could think about:</span></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-left:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">Which sounds were easier and more difficult to find. Why were some harder than others?</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">Which was your favourite sound? Why?</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">Were there any sounds you didn’t like? Why?</span> <br>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 115148931, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 115148060, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>How to play:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 16px;font-family: Verdana;\">Take the scavenger hunt sheet outside with you. You could go in your garden, to a park, or on a walk. </span></li